<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, the Council may issue a directive to facilitate the sharing of information and intelligence between the Government Entities."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
