<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council may invite any person not being a member of the Council to attend its meetings to advise the Council on any matter under discussion. Procedures"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
