<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A declaration made under subsection (1) and the renewal of declaration made under subsection (4) shall be published in the Gazette and laid before Parliament as soon as possible after it has been made, and if resolutions are passed by both Houses of Parliament annulling the declaration, it shall cease to have effect, notwithstanding subsections (3) and (4), but without prejudice to anything previously done by virtue of the declaration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
