<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44> <https://schema.org/text> "All committees established under the existing National Security Council and in force immediately before the commencement of this Act shall, upon the commencement of this Act, continue to remain in force until dissolved by the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
