<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38> <https://schema.org/text> "No action, suit, prosecution or any other proceeding shall lie or be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against the Council, any committee, any member of the Council or committee, the Director of Operations, or any member of the Security Forces or personnel of other Government Entities in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by it or him in good faith, in such capacity. Public servant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
