<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If the member of the Security Forces seizes a dangerous thing from a person and believes on reasonable grounds that the person used the thing in the commission of an offence against any written law, the member of the Security Forces may detain the person for the purpose of placing him in the custody of a police officer at the earliest practicable time. Power to search persons for dangerous things"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/38/eng@> .
